+
+# Rental module: equipment, quote, book
+
+The booking desk needs a rental module. `src/index.ts` exports `createRentalService()`, an in-memory service with:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`: `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }`.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`.
+
+`quote` and `book` throw for an unknown item or a disallowed period; `book` also throws when the item is not free for the whole period.
+
+School rules: money is integer euro cents; times are ISO-8601 UTC; a booking covers whole days (start and end at midnight UTC, end is the start of the day after the last day); no overlapping bookings of the same item; cancellation policy (no refund under 24 h before start, otherwise full refund) is for later.
+
+Out of scope: cancellations.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- Total = dailyPrice x number of days.
+- Non-midnight, non-UTC, malformed, or end <= start periods are rejected.
+- Overlapping bookings of the same item are rejected; adjacent ones are accepted.
